Data governance and access for this project

SwiftHaul relies on Google’s data governance for encryption of at rest and during transit, 
ensuring that our data is secured from end-to-end before the data is stored, and while we operate 
BigQuery for internal and external transmission of data through the internet. 

For this current exercise we have IAM full access control at all levels of project, dataset, tables, 
and views. Permissions could be customized for limited access as needed.

External source: Google's Data Governance in BigQuery
https://docs.cloud.google.com/bigquery/docs/data-governance
